    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.Developer">Developer · Fox_Ryn (Macrohard0001)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.What">What is this?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.WhatBody">Hardmacro Craft Launcher is an independent open-source Minecraft launcher with Windows 11 Fluent design and a side navigation bar. It supports Microsoft / offline login, one-click vanilla and Forge / NeoForge / Fabric / Quilt installs, Modrinth modpacks and mods, version isolation, and mirror acceleration.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.License">License</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.LicenseBody">Released under the MIT license with fully public source. This is an independent project that neither uses nor distributes code from third-party launchers under restrictive licenses.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.Thanks">Credits</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.ThanksBody">CmlLib.Core (MIT), WPF-UI (MIT), Modrinth (open API), BMCLAPI mirror service, and all open-source contributors.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.Disclaimer">Disclaimer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.About.DisclaimerBody">Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Studios. This project is not affiliated with Mojang / Microsoft. Please support the official game.</sys:String>

